An experimental <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> interface tested by Apple would allow widgets to occupy two separate areas of the Lock Screen, according to findings shared by the leaker known as "pdfu."<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/iphone-duo-cyber-monday.jpeg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1078835" /><br/>
The unreleased layout adds a vertical pair of circular widgets on the right side of the screen. Crucially, pdfu says this arrangement can be used together with the existing bottom row, giving users access to more information.<br/>
<br/>
